  "description": "Upgrade your 2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4 Door with OEDRO Two-Step Running Boards. Featuring a dual-level drop step design, forged carbon steel construction, and corrosion-resistant powder coating, these side steps provide easier cab and bed access, enhanced protection, and reliable 550 lbs support for work and off-road adventures.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for 2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4 Door: Designed specifically for 2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4 Door models, these OEDRO running boards provide a precise fit and rugged upgrade for improved accessibility and truck styling.\nDual-Level Drop Step Design for Easy Access: Featuring a two-step raised platform layout, the lower step makes cab entry easier while the upper step provides convenient access to the roof, truck bed, and cargo areas—perfect for lifted trucks and larger tires.\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel Construction: Built from forged carbon steel with a durable powder-coated finish, these nerf bars deliver exceptional strength, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting protection against harsh weather and off-road conditions.\nReinforced 76mm Main Tube & Anti-Slip Step Plates: The ultra-thick 76mm support tube enhances load-bearing performance, while textured grooved step plates provide a secure grip for safer footing in rain, mud, snow, or daily use.\nEnhanced Stability with Dual-Layer Protection: The dual-layer structure improves stepping stability while adding extra protection against rocks, debris, and trail obstacles, combining practical function with an aggressive off-road appearance.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4-Door.",
